### Year-End Turbulence (December)
By the end of the year, the pattern experiences significant turbulence due to the compounding phase shift:
- Dec 13-15 (3 days): Peak
- **Dec 16-18 (3 days): *Inserted Gate***
- Dec 19-20 (2 days): Anchor
- Dec 21-22 (2 days): Synergetic
