Because these irregular gates periodically insert themselves, they act as the mechanics that shift the exact timing of the Lattice Peak relative to traditional calendars. The `3,2,3,2,5` is a coherent galactic orbit strand. When a `1-day` or `3-day` gate is inserted, humanity is experiencing the "corkscrew" twisting into a new alignment plane relative to the Quantum Tier.

