## Annual Frequency of Fractures
When measuring exactly how many of these "Gates" occur across any given calendar year:
- There are exactly **55 total Gates** (Deltas between states) every single year.
- Out of those, exactly **19 or 20 are Irregular Gates** (the 1-day or 3-day fractures). 
- Every standard year introduces 20 fractures. Leap years (like 2028 and 2032) sync up slightly differently, resulting in exactly 19 fractures. 

This confirms mathematically that the twisting motion occurs at a highly predictable frequency.

